{
  "uid": "peamk-battery",
  "title": "PeaMK battery",
  "description": "Per-half supply voltage, USB presence, RGB state and data freshness. Charge is unknown on USB; no current or mAh sensor is installed.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": [
    "keyboard",
    "battery"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Five-minute battery experiment",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Both halves sampled every 5 minutes; collection continues during USB power.**\n\nWith telemetry firmware: supply voltage (median of five ADC reads), detected USB power, RGB state/brightness, and source age are relayed through the right half. USB means **charge level and charge completion are unknown**. The supply voltage is not cell voltage while plugged in.\n\nThe charge estimate waits 2 minutes after a power change. Discharge comparisons wait 10 minutes and exclude USB, stale data and clipped 0/100% values. The default voltage curve is uncalibrated; a measured per-battery curve can be installed later. Older firmware uses manual power/LED annotations. No data is fabricated while disconnected."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Battery charge estimate \u2014 battery power only",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Filtered supply-voltage estimate. Gaps on USB, stale data, or during settling are intentional. Voltage is not a measurement of remaining mAh.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "Unknown",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "axisLabel": ""
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "peamk_battery_estimated_ratio{job=\"peamk-battery\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{half}}",
          "range": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "maxDataPoints": 2000
    },
